    "learningOutcomes": [
      "Plan comprehensive performance marketing campaigns aligned with commercial unit economics, customer journey funnels, and business acquisition goals.",
      "Build and optimize high-intent Google Search campaigns in Google Ads Editor using Single-Theme Ad Groups, keyword match types, and negative sculpting.",
      "Configure Google AI Max search capabilities, automatically created assets, and enforce strict negative keyword and brand safety controls.",
      "Plan and structure Performance Max and Google Shopping campaigns with optimized product feeds, segmented asset groups, and layered audience signals.",
      "Build full-funnel Meta lead and sales acquisition campaigns utilizing ODAX objectives, Advantage+ automation, customer budget caps, and 3x3 creative testing matrices.",
      "Analyze cross-channel paid advertising performance, diagnose placement and device efficiency, and evaluate conversion quality metrics.",
      "Implement end-to-end GA4 and Google Tag Manager (GTM) event tracking using custom dataLayer triggers, parameters, and e-commerce schemas.",
      "Configure and validate primary conversion events, Google Ads Enhanced Conversions for web and leads, and offline data connections in Data Manager.",
      "Explain Meta Pixel and Conversions API (CAPI) architecture, browser-to-server matching, and Event ID deduplication mechanisms.",
      "Diagnose and resolve campaign tracking problems, tag firing errors, duplicate conversion fires, and attribution discrepancies using Tag Assistant and Meta Test Events.",
      "Conduct heuristic landing page CRO analysis using the LIFT model, mobile UX audits, and behavioral heatmaps in Microsoft Clarity.",
      "Create interactive multi-channel performance dashboards in Looker Studio with blended data sources and custom calculated metrics.",
      "Manage multi-channel advertising budgets, daily pacing models, marginal ROAS thresholds, and forecast customer acquisition costs across business scenarios.",
      "Evaluate campaign experiments and A/B split tests with statistical sample-size calculations, confidence thresholds, and minimum detectable effects.",
      "Recommend data-backed pause, improve, or scale decisions using vertical and horizontal scaling frameworks and marginal efficiency analysis."
    ],
