    "fullDesc": "Learn how to design, test and improve effective prompts across ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini. This practical Prompt Engineering & AI Output Evaluation course develops professional skills in writing clear instructions, organizing context, creating reusable prompt templates, designing structured outputs and assessing AI-generated results. Understand the capabilities and limitations of language models, including hallucinations, inconsistent answers, context constraints and differences between models. Develop hands-on experience with few-shot prompting, document-grounded workflows, structured JSON outputs, prompt versioning, test cases and scoring rubrics. Learn how to compare AI models using the same business tasks, identify output failures and improve prompts systematically through evidence-based experimentation. Apply these skills to customer communication, marketing briefs, information extraction, educational materials, reporting and everyday business operations. Build a professional portfolio containing 20 tested business prompts, five structured-output examples, a model comparison evaluation workbook and one fully documented business prompting workflow. The programme prioritizes practical AI reliability, transferable prompting skills, human oversight and responsible AI use rather than dependence on one chatbot or memorizing prompt formulas.",
