    "fullDesc": "Learn to create professional commercial visuals using Adobe Photoshop, from precise photo correction and realistic retouching to advertising creatives and photorealistic image manipulation.\n\nThis practical Adobe Photoshop — Commercial Image Editing & Design course develops hands-on skills in selections, masking, adjustment layers, Camera Raw, Smart Objects, lighting correction, perspective matching and non-destructive editing.\n\nLearn how to professionally enhance product photography, retouch portraits, remove distractions, create realistic shadows and combine multiple images into visually consistent advertising compositions.\n\nExplore modern AI-assisted workflows using Generative Fill, Harmonize and Generative Expand, while learning to correct unwanted AI artifacts and retain full creative control through manual Photoshop techniques.\n\nBuild premium advertising creatives for e-commerce, social media, digital campaigns and print applications.\n\nLearn commercial layout principles, typography, visual hierarchy, color management, resizing, export specifications and professional file organization.\n\nComplete a practical portfolio that includes product retouching before-and-after images, a photorealistic commercial composite, a premium product advertisement and a complete campaign adapted for 4:5, 1:1 and 9:16 formats.\n\nDeliver professional results with organized, editable PSD source files and properly exported artwork.\n\nThe programme focuses on real commercial production quality, Photoshop craftsmanship and professional client handover—not merely memorizing software tools.",
    "positioning": "Learn to create professional commercial visuals using Adobe Photoshop, from precise photo correction and realistic retouching to advertising creatives and photorealistic image manipulation.\n\nThis practical Adobe Photoshop — Commercial Image Editing & Design course develops hands-on skills in selections, masking, adjustment layers, Camera Raw, Smart Objects, lighting correction, perspective matching and non-destructive editing.\n\nLearn how to professionally enhance product photography, retouch portraits, remove distractions, create realistic shadows and combine multiple images into visually consistent advertising compositions.\n\nExplore modern AI-assisted workflows using Generative Fill, Harmonize and Generative Expand, while learning to correct unwanted AI artifacts and retain full creative control through manual Photoshop techniques.\n\nBuild premium advertising creatives for e-commerce, social media, digital campaigns and print applications.\n\nLearn commercial layout principles, typography, visual hierarchy, color management, resizing, export specifications and professional file organization.\n\nComplete a practical portfolio that includes product retouching before-and-after images, a photorealistic commercial composite, a premium product advertisement and a complete campaign adapted for 4:5, 1:1 and 9:16 formats.\n\nDeliver professional results with organized, editable PSD source files and properly exported artwork.\n\nThe programme focuses on real commercial production quality, Photoshop craftsmanship and professional client handover—not merely memorizing software tools.",
