    "shortTitle": "Adobe Illustrator — Vector Graphics & Print Design",
    "shortDesc": "Learn Adobe Illustrator for professional vector graphics, typography, scalable illustration and commercial print design. Build precise, editable artwork using manual vector techniques and responsible AI-assisted workflows.",
    "fullDesc": "Learn how to create professional, scalable vector graphics using Adobe Illustrator.\n\nThis practical Adobe Illustrator — Vector Graphics & Print Design course develops hands-on skills in vector drawing, precision path construction, typography, icon design, illustration and commercial artwork production.\n\nMaster essential Illustrator tools including the Pen Tool, Curvature Tool, Pathfinder, Shape Builder, compound paths, clipping masks, Appearance panel and object transformation controls.\n\nLearn to create consistent icon systems, original illustrations, typography-led layouts, custom lettering foundations and reusable vector assets.\n\nExplore professional illustration techniques including gradients, blends, patterns, brushes and symbols.\n\nDiscover AI-assisted vector concept development with Adobe Illustrator's Text to Vector Graphic and Generative Shape Fill features, while learning to inspect and refine generated geometry manually.\n\nBuild practical production skills in working with multiple artboards, RGB and CMYK color, spot colors, bleeds, PDF exports, SVG exports and linked asset management.\n\nDevelop a professional portfolio containing a consistent 12-icon family, an original vector illustration, a typography-led poster and a production-ready multi-artboard commercial artwork package.\n\nComplete the course with organized, editable Illustrator source files and correctly prepared digital and print deliverables.\n\nThe programme emphasizes vector precision, visual consistency, professional craftsmanship and reliable client handover.",
    "positioning": "Learn how to create professional, scalable vector graphics using Adobe Illustrator.\n\nThis practical Adobe Illustrator — Vector Graphics & Print Design course develops hands-on skills in vector drawing, precision path construction, typography, icon design, illustration and commercial artwork production.\n\nMaster essential Illustrator tools including the Pen Tool, Curvature Tool, Pathfinder, Shape Builder, compound paths, clipping masks, Appearance panel and object transformation controls.\n\nLearn to create consistent icon systems, original illustrations, typography-led layouts, custom lettering foundations and reusable vector assets.\n\nExplore professional illustration techniques including gradients, blends, patterns, brushes and symbols.\n\nDiscover AI-assisted vector concept development with Adobe Illustrator's Text to Vector Graphic and Generative Shape Fill features, while learning to inspect and refine generated geometry manually.\n\nBuild practical production skills in working with multiple artboards, RGB and CMYK color, spot colors, bleeds, PDF exports, SVG exports and linked asset management.\n\nDevelop a professional portfolio containing a consistent 12-icon family, an original vector illustration, a typography-led poster and a production-ready multi-artboard commercial artwork package.\n\nComplete the course with organized, editable Illustrator source files and correctly prepared digital and print deliverables.\n\nThe programme emphasizes vector precision, visual consistency, professional craftsmanship and reliable client handover.",
