    "shortDesc": "Learn professional Canva marketing design, including typography, brand kits, original layouts, social creatives, presentations, reusable templates and responsible AI-assisted workflows.",
    "fullDesc": "Learn how to create professional marketing visuals and maintain consistent brand communication using Canva. This practical Canva Professional — Brand & Marketing Design course combines essential graphic design principles with modern, efficient marketing-content production. Develop hands-on skills in typography, color selection, composition, spacing, alignment, visual hierarchy and layout grids. Learn to create and apply brand colors, typography systems, Brand Kits and reusable templates across different business communication formats. Build original social media designs, educational carousel posts, YouTube thumbnails, banners, posters and product promotions for realistic marketing briefs. Explore Canva AI, Magic tools and AI-assisted design features while learning how to review generated layouts, improve typography, correct visual inconsistencies and verify content. Develop professional presentation skills and create clear, structured business slides. Learn collaborative reviewing, commenting, permissions, approval workflows, bulk design creation fundamentals and appropriate export settings. Build a professional Canva marketing portfolio featuring eight original social designs, one coherent carousel, a reusable template set, a 10-slide business presentation and a one-page brand-use guide. The programme emphasizes original layout decisions, brand consistency, practical design quality and editable deliverables rather than simply modifying ready-made templates. It is designed for entrepreneurs, educators, content creators, marketing assistants and beginner freelance social media designers who want to produce effective business visuals efficiently.",
