      "Position GS1-standard barcodes with correct dimensions, background contrast, quiet zones, and orientation to ensure scannability.",
      "Prepare print-ready files utilizing CMYK, Pantone spot colors, white ink backing, and custom varnish/finishing separation channels.",
      "Perform rigorous technical prepress inspections using Illustrator Separations Preview and Acrobat Pro Output Preview and Preflight.",
      "Render photorealistic multi-angle packaging mockups in Adobe Photoshop simulating paperboard, foil stamping, spot UV, and matte/gloss finishes.",
      "Package and document professional 9-folder client and printer handover archives including native .ai masters, font licensing notes, and technical preflight reports."
