    "fullDesc": "Learn how to transform static HTML and CSS websites into functional, interactive browser applications using modern JavaScript and introductory TypeScript.\n\nThis practical Modern JavaScript & TypeScript Foundations course develops strong programming fundamentals before introducing advanced browser interactions, asynchronous programming and professional development tools.\n\nStart with variables, data types, conditions, loops, functions and logical problem-solving. Learn to work confidently with arrays, objects, destructuring, spread and rest syntax, scope, callbacks, closures and JavaScript modules.\n\nBuild interactive website features using the DOM, event listeners, accessible forms, validation, UI state and local browser storage.\n\nMaster asynchronous JavaScript fundamentals through Promises, async/await, Fetch API, JSON, HTTP requests, network errors and API response handling.\n\nLearn introductory TypeScript skills including type annotations, interfaces, unions, type narrowing, basic generics and type-safe application code.\n\nExplore professional development workflows using VS Code, browser DevTools, npm, Vite, ESLint, Vitest and Git/GitHub.\n\nBuild two complete portfolio applications: an interactive business application featuring forms, search/filters and local persistence, and an API-powered application with properly designed loading, empty, success and error states.\n\nDevelop the confidence to explain, debug, test and maintain your code while preparing for more advanced React and Node.js learning.\n\nThe programme focuses on practical JavaScript programming, working browser applications and introductory TypeScript—not advanced React architecture, server-side Node.js or full-stack development.",
