      "Gather and decode website requirements from non-technical client briefs, discovery interviews, and competitor audits.",
      "Prepare visual sitemaps, information architectures, and low-to-high fidelity wireframes for multi-page websites.",
      "Apply core visual design principles: alignment, proximity, contrast, 60-30-10 color theory, and typographic hierarchy scales.",
      "Use Figma to build code-compliant visual layouts, 12-column grids, design token libraries, and responsive Auto Layout components.",
      "Build, configure, and maintain production-ready WordPress websites deployed via LocalWP local development environments.",
      "Use the modern WordPress Block Editor / Site Editor (Full Site Editing) and Elementor visual containers appropriately without builder bloat.",
      "Build high-performance, fluid responsive websites in Framer utilizing Stacks, Grids, and multi-breakpoint property inheritance.",
      "Build enterprise-grade, semantic visual websites in Webflow using the Client-First naming methodology and relational CMS schemas.",
      "Configure robust lead capture forms with client-side field validation, spam protection (honeypots, Turnstile), and automated webhook routing.",
      "Create engaging, high-performance website micro-interactions, scroll-triggered reveals, parallax effects, and animated FAQ accordions.",
      "Use Generative AI (ChatGPT, Claude, Firefly, Canva AI) and platform agents (Framer Agents, Webflow AI) safely under strict human oversight.",
      "Optimize technical on-page SEO: unique title tags, meta descriptions, semantic heading hierarchies (H1–H4), alt text, and XML sitemaps.",
      "Test website accessibility (WCAG 2.2 AA), keyboard tab order, visible focus rings, color contrast, and multi-device mobile viewport reflow.",
      "Manage operational website maintenance: automated cloud backups, disaster recovery restore simulations, security hygiene, and caching.",
      "Prepare professional client handoff packages: non-technical CMS operating manuals, role delegation, and recorded video walkthroughs.",
      "Present and defend three production-grade portfolio projects spanning WordPress, Framer, and Webflow to demonstrate multi-platform versatility."
